### Ver topología declarada (requiere clave)
GET http://localhost:8082/admin/topology
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me

### Crear cola con DLQ
POST http://localhost:8082/admin/queues
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cine.prueba.queue",
  "durable": true,
  "deadLetterQueue": "cine.prueba.dlq"
}

### Crear exchange direct
POST http://localhost:8082/admin/exchanges
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cine.prueba.direct",
  "type": "direct",
  "durable": true
}

### Crear binding
POST http://localhost:8082/admin/bindings
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queue": "cine.prueba.queue",
  "exchange": "cine.prueba.direct",
  "routingKey": "prueba.evento"
}

### Borrar binding
DELETE http://localhost:8082/admin/bindings
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queue": "cine.prueba.queue",
  "exchange": "cine.prueba.direct",
  "routingKey": "prueba.evento"
}

### Borrar exchange
DELETE http://localhost:8082/admin/exchanges/cine.prueba.direct
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me

### Borrar cola
DELETE http://localhost:8082/admin/queues/cine.prueba.queue
X-Admin-Key: local-admin-key-change-me
